 "remarks": "Welcome Home to a well maintained 2 beds, 1 bath unit, conveniently located in the highly desirable Winnipauk Village. This immaculate home has been recently updated, freshly painted, and has wall to wall carpets in each bedroom. Windowed eat in kitchen has been updated with granite counter tops, stainless steel appliances, a large side by side refrigerator with ice maker, electric stove and oven, dishwasher and microwave. Spacious living/dining room has a wood burning fireplace and mantle. New sliding doors lead out to a lovely, private patio with table and chairs for viewing gorgeous sunsets. Primary bedroom easily fits a king sized bed and has large, built-in closet, wall to wall carpet and large, sunset facing window. Second bedroom fits a king sized bed or two twins, and has large built in closet, wall to wall carpet and eastern facing window. Hall bath is recently renovated with tub/shower. Tenant has access to complexes' fantastic amenities, including two pools, clubhouse, gym and racquetball court. Unit includes the convenience of one assigned parking space and has ample visitor parking. Close to I-95, Merritt Parkway, Route 7, train, shopping, beaches, parks. Very Convenient location.",
